 in carcinogenesis</article-title><source>Trends Endocrinol Metab</source><year>2000b</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>54</fpage><lpage>60</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Trends Endocrinol Metab||11|54||bib8|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10675891</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hromas</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Hufford</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Sutton</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Lu</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>PLAB, a novel placental bone morphogenetic protein</article-title><source>Biochim Biophys Acta</source><year>1997</year><volume>1354</volume><fpage>40</fpage><lpage>44</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Biochim Biophys Acta||1354|40||bib9|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9375789</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Meyer</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Jung</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Lein</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Rudolph</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Schnorr</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Loening</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Factors influencing the ratio of free to total prostate-specific antigen in serum</article-title><source>Int J Cancer</source><year>1997</year><volume>74</volume><fpage>630</fpage><lpage>636</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Int J Cancer||74|630||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9421361</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="